        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Istanbul, Ortaköy, Bosphorus, Küçüksu, Beykoz, Anadoluhisarı, Fatih Sultan Mehmet Bridge\n- Organizations: Kabataş Erkek Lisesi, Kurtalan Ekspres\n- People: Cahit Berkay, Cem Karaca, Barış Manço\n- Buildings: Küçüksu Palace, Göksu Pavilion\n\nFacts:\n- Kabataş Erkek Lisesi is located in Ortaköy on the Bosphorus in Istanbul.\n- Küçüksu Palace, also known as Küçüksu Pavilion or Göksu Pavilion, is a summer palace in Istanbul, Turkey.\n- Küçüksu Palace is situated in the Küçüksu neighborhood of Beykoz on the Asian shore of the Bosphorus between Anadoluhisarı and the Fatih Sultan Mehmet Bridge.\n- Cahit Berkay graduated from Kabataş Erkek Lisesi.\n- Kurtalan Ekspres is a Turkish Anatolian rock band.\n- Kurtalan Ekspres has worked with lead singers including Cem Karaca, Cahit Berkay, and Barış Manço.",
